tion></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pH9BBgyOBJkNJWSZnAehxRES38OvswUgPv6riaooxnVRb4AiarB6XTIARrzJTbodn3kHqYCkCy7pfbyJrx47yH2b66Uwj60s3Qar2dGX1icgsQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>南方科技大学环境科学与工程学院竭诚欢迎全国各高校的优秀应届本科毕业生通过推荐免试方式前来我校攻读研究生（推免硕士生、直博生），学校将提供丰厚的奖助学金和一流的科研条件，欢迎全国的优秀学子踊跃报名！请符合申请条件的申请人（包括南方科技大学本校生）登录南方科技大学研究生招生报考服务系统填报信息。现就有关申请方式及注意事项通知如下：</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><strong><span>南科大环境学院</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>报名信息</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>01 </span></b></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>拥护中国共产党的领导、愿为祖国建设服务、品德良好、遵纪守法的中国公民，且满足以下条件：</span></p></section></section><section><section><ol><li><p><span>全国高校本科三年级在校生（2027年毕业生），预计可获得推免资格；身心健康，符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span></p></li><li><p><span>对科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，有较好的科研潜质、专业能力和较强的创新意识。</span></p></li><li><p><span>诚实守信，学风端正，无任何违法违纪受处分记录。</span></p></li><li><p><span>成绩优秀，英语水平良好。</span></p></li><li><p><span>就读于环境科学、环境工程、水文水资源、自然地理、水文地质、大气科学、生态学、环境化学、环境材料、地理信息科学、遥感科学与技术等与可持续发展相关的专业，或物理、化学、生物、计算机等基础理工科专业。</span></p></li></ol></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>02 </span></b></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>拟招生专业</span></b></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>硕士</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>083000 环境科学与工程（学硕）</span></p><p><span>085700 资源与环境（专硕）</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>博士</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>083000 环境科学与工程（学博）</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>预报名系统中的招生专业供参考，最终录取学科以院系预选拔结果及全国推免服务系统中录取确认为准。</span></strong></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>03 </span></b></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请方式及材料提交</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>即日起-2026年8月30日23:59</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>网上报名</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>登录网址：</span></p><p><span>南方科技大学研究生招生服务系统（https://yzbm.sustech.edu.cn/logon，推荐使用chrome、360浏览器），点击“全国优秀大学生推免生预报名”，选择“</span><strong><span>环境科学与工程学院</span></strong><span>”进行在线报名。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名所需证明材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>申请者需在网上报名系统注册登录，并按照要求提供本人各项真实信息。需填报不超过3个意向报考导师并上传以下证明材料：</span></p></section></section><section><section><ol><li><p><span>身份证正反面扫描件或者照片；</span></p></li><li><p><span>学生证扫描件或者照片；</span></p></li><li><p><span><span>个人简历（中文版）；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span>本科成绩单：包含所修全部课程的正式成绩单（院系或教务公章）；成绩单上注明所在专业的成绩排名；</span></p></li><li><p><span>个人陈述（介绍学术背景、曾经做过的研究工作，以及将来攻读研究生阶段的学习和研究计划、研究生毕业后的就业目标等，1000字以内）；</span></p></li><li><p><span>其他材料：其他体现个人学术水平、综合能力的证明材料（包括但不限于英语水平证书、论文首页及奖状证书等），扫描为一个PDF文件后上传至系统；</span></p></li><li><p><span>申请推免直博研究生的同学，必须提交专家推荐信2封，专家应具有副教授及以上职称（或相当专业技术职称），申请推免硕士研究生的同学可自愿提交；</span></p></li><li><p><span>推免预报名申请表（签字版）。</span></p></li></ol></section></section><section><section><p><span>* 所有报名材料的附件在上传前，请提前按资料类型命名，例如：姓名-身份证、姓名-个人陈述或姓名-个人简历。</span></p></section></section><section><p><strong><span>请报名后积极联系我院导师，招生导师及研究方向见学院官网：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>https://ese.sustech.edu.cn/teacher/index/nid/101.html</span></strong></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>04 </span></b></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>考核安排</span></b></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>审核及通知</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>申请截止后，我系招生审核工作小组将对申请材料进行审核。通过资格审核者将以我校研究生招生服务系统、电话及邮件等方式通知，未通过者不作另外通知。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>面试安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>预计9月进行，具体面试时间与方式以实际通知为准。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>05 </span></b></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>咨询方式</span></b></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>请优先以“</span><strong><span>预推免咨询+姓名+学校</span></strong><span>”为邮件主题发送给：</span><strong><span><span>hjyzb@sustech.edu.cn</span></span></strong><span>或致电</span><strong><span><span>0755-88018140</span></span></strong><span>, 林老师</span></p><p><span>或加入南科大环境研招交流群：631912225（</span><strong><span>备注预推免+姓名+学校</span></strong><span>）</span></p><p><span>更多招生导师相关信息请关注南方科技大学环境科学与工程学院：</span></p><p><span>http://ese.sustech.edu.cn/</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/gZ419VicwdytBMqmiayibrIRicANCd3iad2H9mLIe8xtSRHH3JyInMKdnvl10DOpuubADia7HhKO8ibl9kkPaKg2uxrSw2shJOXduvZFuicmpH7DxOU/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mm